      "purpose": "Reuse automatic-language encoder only within the same full-context call. Propagate abort polls into CPU graph operations, including automatic-language detection. A private Tilo entry point permits encoder reuse with its pure lock-free stop poll; the public API retains its callback-free reuse guard. Final inference uses fresh state and no abort callback. Acoustic graph execution failures return false rather than successful uncomputed probabilities."
